Transport Multiple Variables
What if I want to modify multiple columns?

Use across()!


std_column &lt;- function(data, variables) {
  stopifnot(is.data.frame(data))

  data &lt;- data |&gt; 
    mutate(across(.cols = {{variables}},
                  .fns = ~ std_vec(.x)))
  return(data)
}

